{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1176","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Lose it!"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array $$$a$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ integers. Each $$$a_i$$$ is one of the six following numbers: $$$4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to remove the minimum number of elements to make this array "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An array of length $$$k$$$ is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$k$$$ is divisible by $$$6$$$ and it is possible to split it into $$$\\frac{k}{6}$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"subsequences"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples of good arrays:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42]$$$ (the whole array is a required sequence); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4, 8, 4, 15, 16, 8, 23, 15, 16, 42, 23, 42]$$$ (the first sequence is formed from first, second, fourth, fifth, seventh and tenth elements and the second one is formed from remaining elements); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[]$$$ ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"the empty array is good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples of bad arrays: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4, 8, 15, 16, 42, 23]$$$ (the order of elements should be exactly $$$4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42$$$); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42, 4]$$$ (the length of the array is not divisible by $$$6$$$); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42, 4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 23]$$$ (the first sequence can be formed from first six elements but the remaining array cannot form the required sequence). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 5 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of elements in $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the input contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ (each $$$a_i$$$ is one of the following numbers: $$$4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42$$$), where $$$a_i$$$ is the $$$i$$$-th element of $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer — the minimum number of elements you have to remove to obtain a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" array."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n4 8 15 16 23\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n12\n4 8 4 15 16 8 23 15 16 42 23 42\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n15\n4 8 4 8 15 16 8 16 23 15 16 4 42 23 42\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1176C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1176/problem/C"}